# Title: Clear PowerShell History - PowerShell Module
# ID: f99276ad-d122-4989-a09a-d00904a5f9d2
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Ilyas Ochkov, Jonhnathan Ribeiro, Daniil Yugoslavskiy, oscd.community
# Date: 2019-10-25
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1070.003
# Description: Detects keywords that could indicate clearing PowerShell history
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((Payload contains "Set-PSReadlineOption" AND Payload contains "–HistorySaveStyle" AND Payload contains "SaveNothing")) OR ((Payload contains "Set-PSReadlineOption" AND Payload contains "-HistorySaveStyle" AND Payload contains "SaveNothing"))) OR (((Payload contains "del" OR Payload contains "Remove-Item" OR Payload contains "rm")) AND (Payload contains "(Get-PSReadlineOption).HistorySavePath")))
